    "description": "Every arm identity of this issue, once, over all three case shapes, so the wire contract between benchmark-ab-runner and the arm binary is established by an execution rather than by reading code. The receipt is a throwaway: every cell is exploratory, the stage decides nothing, and its samples enter no pilot or confirmation."
